<title>GERMANY: German stock market closed on Tuesday Dec 31.</title>
<headline>German stock market closed on Tuesday Dec 31.</headline>
<text>
<p>0731 GMT - German stock exchange is closed for the day on Tuesday December 31. The markets will remain closed on Wednesday January 1 and will re-open again on Thursday January 2.</p>
